cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Bosch Smart System — verified BLE field map"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "redundo.app"
    website: "https://redundo.app"
abstract: >-
  Ground-truth-verified reverse-engineering of the Bosch Smart System eBike
  Bluetooth LE interface: the diagnostic telemetry channel (0x0011), the
  official Live Data Interface (eb21), field scalings, frame format, the
  stored-log transport, and capture method. Verified on a BDU3740 /
  Performance Line CX.
license: CC-BY-4.0
year: 2026
url: "https://redundo.app"
keywords:
  - bosch
  - ebike
  - smart-system
  - bluetooth-le
  - reverse-engineering
  - telemetry
references:
  - type: software
    title: "bosch-bes3-reader — Bosch BES3 USB diagnostic address registry"
    authors:
      - family-names: Weijnen
        given-names: Remko
    url: "https://github.com/rweijnen/bosch-bes3-reader"
    license: CC-BY-4.0
    notes: >-
      Reverse-engineered ~895-address BES3 registry read over USB-C. Used as the
      canonical field-name/address reference that this project's BLE-reachability
      results are keyed to.
